I think its a great idea, and it ought to be
straightforward.  Zelig is now used in Dataverse Network Project
software (see http://TheData.org) and by a related project at the U.S.
Census Bureau for similar plug-ins.  The describe.mymodel() functions
self-describe the models, and so are designed to build GUIs from
Zelig.  Please do let us know what you come up with.



Best,

Gary

